boswas-compat (1.0~alpha2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Boswas WinCompat (Milestone 1).
    - boswas-winapp: install, remove, list, launch, status, repair, logs,
      catalog and manifest validation, with --json output.
    - One isolated Wine prefix per application, run inside a bubblewrap
      sandbox and confined by the boswas-winapp AppArmor profile.
    - Compatibility manifest format v1 and layered catalog.
    - WinCompat policy (/etc/boswas/compat/policy.conf).
    - "Run with Boswas" handler for Windows installers.

 -- Boswas OS Platform Team <os-platform@boswas.invalid>  Sun, 04 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
